  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to study Zambia&apos;s budget process in relation to transparency and public participation. It is being implemented by the South African NGO, Idasa, and the research is being done by a local research team which comprises of a lead researcher and two assistants from civil society. The project is being undertaken in three other countries.</narrative>
